# MERGE-PARENT-MODEL-SOURCE: as unit_merge_parent_model_later, the candidate a merge of Wide {pad; x}: x is at slot 1
# of the value, and User's read of a3\x takes it through the coordinates of Wide, the declaration that reaches the
# input, by the record the execution made -- not slot 0.  Natively and with the root walked; the methods-walked twin is
# the implementation gap of unit_merge_parent_model_later.  Exit 7; 81 if u1 read anything but 2.
Wide:
    int: pad 9
    int: x 2
end: Wide
User:
    int: y 0
    y: a3\x
end: User
u1: merge: User
a3: merge: Wide
u1
int: ok 7
if: u1\y != 2
    ok: 81
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: ok; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
